來畫面超壯觀，蔬菜堆得像座小山，我先分成兩碗才開始吃！\n湯頭是醬油風味帶點辣，配上背脂和大蒜，香氣超級提升，特別迷人。麵條是粗麵，有嚼勁又Q彈，份量多到吃不完，口味偏重，但搭配大量的蔬菜剛好解膩，吃起來不會覺得太油膩。整體吃完真的超級滿足，食量不大的人可能會吃撐。\n結論：如果不介意排隊的話，強烈推薦給食量大的朋友來嚐嚐看！這家拉麵的客製化和日式氛圍真的很加分，下次我一定會再來～",null,[0,178]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7726299136435455624/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVzUzFsck1EVk9XRXBWVDBWd01WUkZhRzlUTUdoR1dUTlNabEpGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,28560,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sS1lrMDVOWEpVT0VwMVRFaG9TMGhGWTNSZlJFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7623ec854cb36b50!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnlKYk05NXJUOEp1TEhoS0hFY3RfREE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sS1lrMDVOWEpVT0VwMVRFaG9TMGhGWTNSZlJFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sS1lrMDVOWEpVT0VwMVRFaG9TMGhGWTNSZlJFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sS1lrMDVOWEpVT0VwMVRFaG9TMGhGWTNSZlJFRRILMGRma1VuUFJ6VE8aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09ubEtZazA1Tlh